<script data-page="app" type="application/json">{"component":"flashcards\/study","props":{"errors":{},"name":"Topwords","auth":{"user":{"id":5,"name":"\u00c1rp\u00e1d Szaniszl\u00f3","email":"developedbybarley@gmail.com","email_verified_at":null,"two_factor_confirmed_at":null,"streak":8,"quiz_completions":1,"text_analyses":14,"last_activity_date":"2026-05-11T00:00:00.000000Z","onboarding_completed_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:25.000000Z","created_at":"2026-04-18T19:40:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-05-11T10:01:30.000000Z","stripe_id":"cus_UR8u0ziMkWwJIo","pm_type":null,"pm_last_four":null,"trial_ends_at":null,"ai_access":false,"subscriptions":[]},"isAdmin":true,"subscription":{"hasActiveAccess":true,"isSubscribed":false,"isPremium":false,"hasAiAccess":false,"isOnTrial":false}},"sidebarOpen":true,"flash":{"streakTriggered":null,"success":null,"achievements":[],"calibrationPrompt":null,"showTour":false,"importedCardId":null},"deck":{"id":38,"name":"May"},"cards":[{"id":51272,"front":"<p>Due to unforeseen _______, the wedding had to be postponed. <em>(k\u00f6r\u00fclm\u00e9nyek \/ helyzet)<\/em><\/p><p>The judge considered all the _______ before making a decision. <em>(t\u00e9nyez\u0151k \/ viszonyok)<\/em><\/p><p>The research paper analyzed the socio-economic _______ that contributed to the decline. <em>(h\u00e1tt\u00e9r \/ k\u00f6rnyezet)<\/em><\/p><p>She found herself in a difficult _______, with no easy way out. <em>(helyzet \/ \u00e1llapot)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">k\u00f6r\u00fclm\u00e9ny \/ helyzet \/ t\u00e9nyez\u0151 \/ viszony \/ \u00e1llapot<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): szabads\u00e1g \/ f\u00fcggetlens\u00e9g \/ egyszer\u0171s\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 under the _______ of = valaminek a _______ alatt (pl. under the _______ of his parents)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 given the _______ = a _______eket figyelembe v\u00e9ve (pl. given the _______, we should proceed cautiously)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 extenuating _______ = enyh\u00edt\u0151 _______ek (pl. there were extenuating _______ for his absence)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 adverse _______ = kedvez\u0151tlen _______ek (pl. the project faced adverse _______)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 difficult _______ = neh\u00e9z _______ek (pl. she overcame many difficult _______)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>circumstance<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>circumstance<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: difficult circumstances \/ unforeseen circumstances \/ extenuating circumstances \/ given the circumstances<\/span><\/p><p>similar: situation \/ condition \/ factor \/ state of affairs<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: certainty \/ freedom \/ simplicity<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"circumstance","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-12T18:54:13+00:00"},{"id":51288,"front":"<p>The street _______ was selling fresh flowers and handmade crafts at the market. <em>(\u00e1rus \/ keresked\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>Before purchasing the software, we need to evaluate the different _______ options available. <em>(sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 \/ forgalmaz\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>The company decided to switch to a new IT _______ after experiencing poor service from their previous one. <em>(szolg\u00e1ltat\u00f3 \/ besz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>At the trade show, each _______ showcased their latest products and innovations. <em>(ki\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 \/ elad\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elad\u00f3 \/ \u00e1rus \/ sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): vev\u0151 \/ v\u00e1s\u00e1rl\u00f3 \/ fogyaszt\u00f3<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 third-party _______ = harmadik f\u00e9l sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 (pl. We rely on a third-party _______ for our logistics.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 software _______ = szoftver sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 (pl. Choosing the right software _______ is crucial for our operations.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 street _______ = utcai \u00e1rus (pl. The street _______ offered delicious hot dogs.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 preferred _______ = prefer\u00e1lt sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 (pl. They are our preferred _______ for office supplies.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>vendor<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>vendor<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: vendor agreement \/ vendor management \/ vendor relationship \/ vendor selection<\/span><\/p><p>similar: seller \/ supplier \/ merchant \/ dealer<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: buyer \/ customer \/ purchaser<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-11T09:42:48+00:00"},{"id":51278,"front":"<p>It took me a while to _______ to the new city&#039;s fast pace. <em>(hozz\u00e1szokik \/ megszokik)<\/em><\/p><p>The company aims to _______ its employees to the new software system by providing extensive training. <em>(hozz\u00e1szoktat \/ megismertet \/ felk\u00e9sz\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p>Researchers are studying how to _______ laboratory animals to the experimental conditions without causing undue stress. <em>(hozz\u00e1szoktat \/ alkalmazkod\u00e1sra b\u00edr)<\/em><\/p><p>She had to _______ herself to the harsh realities of life on the frontier. <em>(hozz\u00e1szoktat \/ felv\u00e9rtez \/ felk\u00e9sz\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">hozz\u00e1szokik \/ megszokik \/ hozz\u00e1szoktat \/ alkalmazkodik \/ szoktat<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): nem szokik hozz\u00e1 \/ idegenkedik \/ ellen\u00e1ll<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ to something = hozz\u00e1szokik valamihez (pl. It takes time to _______ to the cold weather.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ someone to something = hozz\u00e1szoktat valakit valamihez (pl. We need to _______ the new employees _______ the company culture.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ oneself to something = hozz\u00e1szoktatja mag\u00e1t valamihez (pl. He had to _______ himself _______ the long hours.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ to change = hozz\u00e1szokik a v\u00e1ltoz\u00e1shoz (pl. It&#039;s important to _______ to change in this industry.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>accustom<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>accustom<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: accustom to \/ accustom oneself to \/ accustom to change \/ accustom to new environment<\/span><\/p><p>similar: familiarize \/ habituate \/ adapt \/ orient<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: unfamiliarize \/ disorient \/ alienate<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"accustom","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":1,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-13T18:44:31+00:00"},{"id":51286,"front":"<p>It&#039;s easy to _______ the warning signs when you&#039;re in a hurry, but it can have serious consequences. <em>(figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy \/ nem vesz tudom\u00e1sul)<\/em><\/p><p>The committee decided to _______ the minor procedural error and proceed with the vote. <em>(mell\u0151z \/ nem vesz figyelembe)<\/em><\/p><p>Such a blatant _______ for safety regulations is unacceptable and will result in severe penalties. <em>(semmibe v\u00e9tel \/ figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite repeated pleas, the government continued its _______ for public opinion on the controversial policy. <em>(mell\u0151z\u00e9s \/ nemt\u00f6r\u0151d\u00f6ms\u00e9g)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy \/ semmibe vesz \/ mell\u0151z<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): figyelembe vesz \/ t\u00f6r\u0151dik vele \/ fontosnak tart<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a warning = figyelmeztet\u00e9st figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy (pl. He chose to _______ a warning about the icy roads.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ advice = tan\u00e1csot semmibe vesz (pl. She decided to _______ her doctor&#039;s advice.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a complete _______ for = teljes figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy\u00e1s valami ir\u00e1nt (pl. His actions showed a complete _______ for the rules.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ the law = semmibe veszi a t\u00f6rv\u00e9nyt (pl. Some companies _______ the law to cut costs.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>disregard<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>disregard<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>disregard<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: disregard for safety \/ disregard for rules \/ disregard for consequences \/ disregard for feelings<\/span><\/p><p>similar: ignore \/ overlook \/ neglect \/ discount<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: heed \/ observe \/ regard<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-11T16:47:23+00:00"},{"id":51265,"front":"<p>Please use the designated _______ crossing to get to the other side of the street. <em>(gyalogos \/ \u00e1tkel\u0151hely)<\/em><\/p><p>The new urban planning initiative aims to improve safety and accessibility for all _______. <em>(gyalogosok \/ k\u00f6zleked\u0151k)<\/em><\/p><p>The study analyzed traffic flow patterns, differentiating between vehicular and _______ movement. <em>(gyalogos \/ l\u00e1bbal halad\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>He found solace in the quiet rhythm of his own footsteps, a solitary _______ on the moonlit path. <em>(gyalogos \/ v\u00e1ndorl\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">gyalogos \/ l\u00e1bbal k\u00f6zleked\u0151 \/ s\u00e9t\u00e1l\u00f3 \/ gyalog<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): j\u00e1rm\u0171 \/ aut\u00f3s \/ motoros<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ crossing = gyalogos \u00e1tkel\u0151hely (pl. Look both ways before crossing the _______ crossing.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ safety = gyalogosbiztons\u00e1g (pl. The city is investing in better _______ safety measures.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ zone = gyalogos z\u00f3na (pl. This area is a _______ zone, so cars are not allowed.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ traffic = gyalogos forgalom (pl. The sidewalk is designed to accommodate heavy _______ traffic.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>pedestrian<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>pedestrian<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>pedestrian<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: pedestrian crossing \/ pedestrian zone \/ pedestrian safety \/ pedestrian traffic<\/span><\/p><p>similar: walker \/ foot traveler \/ on-foot \/ non-motorized<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: vehicle \/ motorist \/ driver<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"2 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-13T15:22:10+00:00"},{"id":51284,"front":"<p>The toddler managed to _______ the delicate toy, leaving only broken pieces. <em>(sz\u00e9tt\u00e9p \/ \u00f6sszet\u00f6r \/ t\u00f6nkretesz)<\/em><\/p><p>The accident caused such severe damage that the car&#039;s chassis was completely _______. <em>(elferd\u00fcl \/ \u00f6sszenyom\u00f3dik \/ deform\u00e1l\u00f3dik)<\/em><\/p><p>The investigative report detailed how the company&#039;s practices had _______ the livelihoods of local residents. <em>(t\u00f6nkretesz \/ megsemmis\u00edt \/ rombol)<\/em><\/p><p>The old printing press would often _______ the paper, creating smudged and illegible text. <em>(elront \/ roncsol \/ sz\u00e9tcinc\u00e1l)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">t\u00f6nkretesz \/ sz\u00e9tt\u00e9p \/ \u00f6sszet\u00f6r \/ elront \/ roncsol<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): megjav\u00edt \/ helyre\u00e1ll\u00edt \/ \u00e9p\u00edt<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the evidence = bizony\u00edt\u00e9kokat elt\u00fcntet\/megsemmis\u00edt (pl. null)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ someone&#039;s reputation = valaki h\u00edrnev\u00e9t t\u00f6nkreteszi (pl. null)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ a machine = egy g\u00e9pet t\u00f6nkretesz\/roncsol (pl. null)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the fabric = az anyagot sz\u00e9tt\u00e9pi\/roncsolja (pl. null)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>mangle<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>mangler<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>mangle<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: mangle evidence \/ mangle reputation \/ mangle a document \/ mangle a machine<\/span><\/p><p>similar: destroy \/ ruin \/ smash<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: repair \/ fix \/ restore<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"mangle\nmangler","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-13T18:42:04+00:00"},{"id":51291,"front":"<p>He climbed the _______ to reach the top shelf in the garage. <em>(l\u00e9tra \/ fell\u00e9p\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>The company&#039;s rapid growth allowed employees to quickly move up the career _______. <em>(rangl\u00e9tra \/ el\u0151meneteli lehet\u0151s\u00e9g)<\/em><\/p><p>Firefighters used a long extension _______ to rescue the cat from the tree. <em>(kitolhat\u00f3 l\u00e9tra \/ hossz\u00fa l\u00e9tra)<\/em><\/p><p>The social _______ in many societies makes it difficult for individuals to improve their status. <em>(t\u00e1rsadalmi rangl\u00e9tra \/ t\u00e1rsadalmi hierarchia)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">l\u00e9tra \/ rangl\u00e9tra \/ fell\u00e9p\u0151<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): lejt\u0151 \/ s\u00fcllyed\u00e9s \/ visszal\u00e9p\u00e9s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 climb a _______ = l\u00e9tr\u00e1t m\u00e1szik (pl. Be careful when you climb a _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 extension _______ = kitolhat\u00f3 l\u00e9tra (pl. We need an extension _______ to paint the high wall.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 social _______ = t\u00e1rsadalmi rangl\u00e9tra (pl. Moving up the social _______ can be challenging.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 career _______ = karrierl\u00e9tra (pl. She&#039;s quickly moving up the career _______ at her company.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 rope _______ = k\u00f6t\u00e9ll\u00e9tra (pl. The ship had a rope _______ for emergencies.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>ladder<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>ladder<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82