searchers aim to _______ the effectiveness of the new drug through rigorous clinical trials. <em>(felm\u00e9rni \/ meg\u00e1llap\u00edtani)<\/em><\/p><p>She tried to _______ his motives, but his actions remained ambiguous. <em>(meg\u00edt\u00e9lni \/ felbecs\u00fclni)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">felm\u00e9rni \/ \u00e9rt\u00e9kelni \/ meg\u00edt\u00e9lni \/ becs\u00fclni \/ felbecs\u00fclni<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): elhanyagolni \/ figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagyni \/ megtagadni<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the damage = felm\u00e9rni a k\u00e1rt (pl. assess the damage)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the situation = felm\u00e9rni a helyzetet (pl. assess the situation)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the risk = felm\u00e9rni a kock\u00e1zatot (pl. assess the risk)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the impact = felm\u00e9rni a hat\u00e1st (pl. assess the impact)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the performance = \u00e9rt\u00e9kelni a teljes\u00edtm\u00e9nyt (pl. assess the performance)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>assess<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>assessed<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>assessment<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>assess<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: assess the damage \/ assess the situation \/ assess the risk \/ assess the impact<\/span><\/p><p>similar: evaluate \/ judge \/ appraise \/ gauge<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: neglect \/ ignore \/ overlook<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"4 nap","easy":"5 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-13T18:42:55+00:00"},{"id":51268,"front":"<p>He&#039;s so _______, he never changes his 