":"2026-05-11T10:45:10+00:00"},{"id":51273,"front":"<p>I am _______ informing you that your application has been approved. <em>(ezennel \/ ez\u00e1ltal)<\/em><\/p><p>The company _______ declares its commitment to sustainability. <em>(ez\u00faton \/ hivatalosan)<\/em><\/p><p>This document _______ grants the recipient full access to the archives. <em>(t\u00f6rv\u00e9nyesen \/ jogilag)<\/em><\/p><p>He _______ bequeathed his entire fortune to his alma mater. <em>(v\u00e9grendeletileg \/ hivatalosan)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">ezennel \/ ez\u00e1ltal \/ ez\u00faton \/ ezennel fogva \/ ezennel is<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): nem hivatalosan \/ inform\u00e1lisan \/ sz\u00f3ban<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ inform = ezennel t\u00e1j\u00e9koztat (pl. I am _______ informing you of the changes.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ declare = ezennel kijelent (pl. The committee _______ declares the motion passed.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ grant = ezennel megad (pl. This permit _______ grants you permission to enter.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ appoint = ezennel kinevez (pl. The board _______ appoints him as the new CEO.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>hereby<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: hereby inform \/ hereby declare \/ hereby grant \/ hereby appoint<\/span><\/p><p>similar: by this means \/ thus \/ hence \/ thereby<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: informally \/ unofficially \/ verbally<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"hereby","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-11T15:21:42+00:00"},{"id":51288,"front":"<p>The street _______ was selling fresh flowers and handmade crafts at the market. <em>(\u00e1rus \/ keresked\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>Before purchasing the software, we need to evaluate the different _______ options available. <em>(sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 \/ forgalmaz\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>The company decided to switch to a new IT _______ after experiencing poor service from their previous one. <em>(szolg\u00e1ltat\u00f3 \/ besz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>At the trade show, each _______ showcased their latest products and innovations. <em>(ki\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 \/ elad\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elad\u00f3 \/ \u00e1rus \/ sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): vev\u0151 \/ v\u00e1s\u00e1rl\u00f3 \/ fogyaszt\u00f3<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 third-party _______ = harmadik f\u00e9l sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 (pl. We rely on a third-party _______ for our logistics.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 software _______ = szoftver sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 (pl. Choosing the right software _______ is crucial for our operations.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 street _______ = utcai \u00e1rus (pl. The street _______ offered delicious hot dogs.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 preferred _______ = prefer\u00e1lt sz\u00e1ll\u00edt\u00f3 (pl. They are our preferred _______ for office supplies.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>vendor<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>vendor<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: vendor agreement \/ vendor management \/ vendor relationship \/ vendor selection<\/span><\/p><p>similar: seller \/ supplier \/ merchant \/ dealer<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: buyer \/ customer \/ purchaser<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-11T08:42:25+00:00"},{"id":51287,"front":"<p>Please _______ of your waste responsibly by using the recycling bins provided. <em>(megszabadul \/ eldob \/ kidob)<\/em><\/p><p>The company decided to _______ of its non-essential assets to reduce debt. <em>(elad \/ \u00e9rt\u00e9kes\u00edt \/ megszabadul)<\/em><\/p><p>He was able to _______ of the problem quickly and efficiently. <em>(megold \/ elint\u00e9z \/ rendez)<\/em><\/p><p>The general will _______ his troops for battle at dawn. <em>(elrendez \/ fel\u00e1ll\u00edt \/ csatarendbe \u00e1ll\u00edt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">megszabadul \/ elrendez \/ elad<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): megtart \/ meg\u0151riz \/ beszerez<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of something = megszabadul valamit\u0151l (pl. We need to dispose of these old documents.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of waste = hullad\u00e9kot elhelyez\/kidob (pl. How do you dispose of hazardous waste?)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of assets = vagyont\u00e1rgyakat elad\/megszabadul t\u0151l\u00fck (pl. The firm plans to dispose of its foreign assets.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ of a problem = megold egy probl\u00e9m\u00e1t (pl. He quickly disposed of the minor issue.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>dispose<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>disposable<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>disposal<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>dispose<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: dispose of \/ waste dispose \/ assets dispose \/ properly dispose<\/span><\/p><p>similar: discard \/ get rid of \/ sell \/ arrange<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: keep \/ retain \/ acquire<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review"