e careful \/ watch out \/ take care \/ mind<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: trust \/ approach \/ welcome<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"beware","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":1,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"2 nap","good":"2 nap","easy":"3 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-11T09:45:17+00:00"},{"id":51273,"front":"<p>I am _______ informing you that your application has been approved. <em>(ezennel \/ ez\u00e1ltal)<\/em><\/p><p>The company _______ declares its commitment to sustainability. <em>(ez\u00faton \/ hivatalosan)<\/em><\/p><p>This document _______ grants the recipient full access to the archives. <em>(t\u00f6rv\u00e9nyesen \/ jogilag)<\/em><\/p><p>He _______ bequeathed his entire fortune to his alma mater. <em>(v\u00e9grendeletileg \/ hivatalosan)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">ezennel \/ ez\u00e1ltal \/ ez\u00faton \/ ezennel fogva \/ ezennel is<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): nem hivatalosan \/ inform\u00e1lisan \/ sz\u00f3ban<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ inform = ezennel t\u00e1j\u00e9koztat (pl. I am _______ informing you of the changes.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ declare = ezennel kijelent (pl. The committee _______ declares the motion passed.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ grant = ezennel megad (pl. This permit _______ grants you permission to enter.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ appoint = ezennel kinevez (pl. The board _______ appoints him as the new CEO.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>hereby<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: hereby inform \/ hereby declare \/ hereby grant \/ hereby appoint<\/span><\/p><p>similar: by this means \/ thus \/ hence \/ thereby<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: i